        <tr id="comment-body-2633065"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Aecbcec11-f098-4810-8f24-650664eabec1" class="user-hover" rel="712020:ecbcec11-f098-4810-8f24-650664eabec1" data-account-id="712020:ecbcec11-f098-4810-8f24-650664eabec1" accountid="712020:ecbcec11-f098-4810-8f24-650664eabec1" rel="noreferrer">Ahmed Al-Raweshidy</a> After a quick review I agree with the approach that we have one story to encompass all of this rather than splitting into multiple stories, particularly since 90% of the requirments apply to all of the RDM tables. Also, from a technical perspective I have already done much of the solutioning. However, since <a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A8e32e5a4-f9bd-4093-8833-838bef743021" class="user-hover" rel="712020:8e32e5a4-f9bd-4093-8833-838bef743021" data-account-id="712020:8e32e5a4-f9bd-4093-8833-838bef743021" accountid="712020:8e32e5a4-f9bd-4093-8833-838bef743021" rel="noreferrer">Danny Smith</a> and <a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Aa12e418b-2c1e-4b88-aea9-b64500f8f8f9" class="user-hover" rel="712020:a12e418b-2c1e-4b88-aea9-b64500f8f8f9" data-account-id="712020:a12e418b-2c1e-4b88-aea9-b64500f8f8f9" accountid="712020:a12e418b-2c1e-4b88-aea9-b64500f8f8f9" rel="noreferrer">Abby Parker</a> have put a lot of prior and recent thought into this, I suggest that you, Danny and I set some time aside ASAP (like tomorrow, 25 Feb, to review any prior cancelled stories and any work Abby may have done to make sure we have everything incorporated eveything here without any duplications or omissions. <a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Ab710f8ec-c074-4013-916b-e98b111f7e29" class="user-hover" rel="712020:b710f8ec-c074-4013-916b-e98b111f7e29" data-account-id="712020:b710f8ec-c074-4013-916b-e98b111f7e29" accountid="712020:b710f8ec-c074-4013-916b-e98b111f7e29" rel="noreferrer">Niraj Thakker</a> and <a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Aef6dc51c-ea62-4cfb-9a5c-4c879c9daa7a" class="user-hover" rel="712020:ef6dc51c-ea62-4cfb-9a5c-4c879c9daa7a" data-account-id="712020:ef6dc51c-ea62-4cfb-9a5c-4c879c9daa7a" accountid="712020:ef6dc51c-ea62-4cfb-9a5c-4c879c9daa7a" rel="noreferrer">Alan Slater</a> for visibility.</p>
