            <p><a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Aecbcec11-f098-4810-8f24-650664eabec1" class="user-hover" rel="712020:ecbcec11-f098-4810-8f24-650664eabec1" data-account-id="712020:ecbcec11-f098-4810-8f24-650664eabec1" accountid="712020:ecbcec11-f098-4810-8f24-650664eabec1" rel="noreferrer">Ahmed Al-Raweshidy</a> <a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A0d055962-1974-4273-b8d7-7a97dd766aa8" class="user-hover" rel="712020:0d055962-1974-4273-b8d7-7a97dd766aa8" data-account-id="712020:0d055962-1974-4273-b8d7-7a97dd766aa8" accountid="712020:0d055962-1974-4273-b8d7-7a97dd766aa8" rel="noreferrer">Ken Reynolds</a> <a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A8e32e5a4-f9bd-4093-8833-838bef743021" class="user-hover" rel="712020:8e32e5a4-f9bd-4093-8833-838bef743021" data-account-id="712020:8e32e5a4-f9bd-4093-8833-838bef743021" accountid="712020:8e32e5a4-f9bd-4093-8833-838bef743021" rel="noreferrer">Danny Smith</a> i cant sign off on this story as it is a solution story. My concerns here are around the number of new custom objects being created and the ability to add/remove/edit products and product reference data in SF without tighter access controls for the data governance persona. But i will take Ken’s steer on this from a solution and technical perspective and Danny’s steer on whether the downstream requirements are air-tight</p>
        </td></tr>
