        <tr id="comment-body-2634671"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Ab710f8ec-c074-4013-916b-e98b111f7e29" class="user-hover" rel="712020:b710f8ec-c074-4013-916b-e98b111f7e29" data-account-id="712020:b710f8ec-c074-4013-916b-e98b111f7e29" accountid="712020:b710f8ec-c074-4013-916b-e98b111f7e29" rel="noreferrer">Niraj Thakker</a> The User Stories relating to the integration of product ref data from Salesforce to RDM have not yet gone through refinement, so I wouldn’t be confident to say that the requirements that are dependant on this story are air-tight until after they have been through refinement</p>
