            <p>Abby noted multiple missing AC that are required, this story is blocked pending an additional AC. Removed from sprint after speaking to Lisa and Niraj as Abby needs to create a supporting story to unblock this. <a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Aa12e418b-2c1e-4b88-aea9-b64500f8f8f9" class="user-hover" rel="712020:a12e418b-2c1e-4b88-aea9-b64500f8f8f9" data-account-id="712020:a12e418b-2c1e-4b88-aea9-b64500f8f8f9" accountid="712020:a12e418b-2c1e-4b88-aea9-b64500f8f8f9" rel="noreferrer">Abby Parker</a> <a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Ab710f8ec-c074-4013-916b-e98b111f7e29" class="user-hover" rel="712020:b710f8ec-c074-4013-916b-e98b111f7e29" data-account-id="712020:b710f8ec-c074-4013-916b-e98b111f7e29" accountid="712020:b710f8ec-c074-4013-916b-e98b111f7e29" rel="noreferrer">Niraj Thakker</a> <a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A788133f5-d160-4a3f-a9e4-c5a8154abc43" class="user-hover" rel="712020:788133f5-d160-4a3f-a9e4-c5a8154abc43" data-account-id="712020:788133f5-d160-4a3f-a9e4-c5a8154abc43" accountid="712020:788133f5-d160-4a3f-a9e4-c5a8154abc43" rel="noreferrer">Lisa Hamilton</a> <a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A3d91f870-3d69-4083-95f8-1e92e1e20cf4" class="user-hover" rel="712020:3d91f870-3d69-4083-95f8-1e92e1e20cf4" data-account-id="712020:3d91f870-3d69-4083-95f8-1e92e1e20cf4" accountid="712020:3d91f870-3d69-4083-95f8-1e92e1e20cf4" rel="noreferrer">Raghavendra Dammalapati</a> <a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A51998624-a399-42d9-bda9-bf91b0c4adf3" class="user-hover" rel="712020:51998624-a399-42d9-bda9-bf91b0c4adf3" data-account-id="712020:51998624-a399-42d9-bda9-bf91b0c4adf3" accountid="712020:51998624-a399-42d9-bda9-bf91b0c4adf3" rel="noreferrer">Ahemaiti Subate</a> </p>
